{"id": "Dds2f4ookEO", "title": "Video by sabyasachiofficial", "description": "SABYASACHI BRIDAL COUTURE\nExceptional Lehengas\n\nCreated in the ateliers of Sabyasachi from the finest materials and handcrafted by master embroiderers whose skills have been honed over generations, this collection represents the pinnacle of artisanal excellence.\n\nEvery detail, honours rare techniques and exceptional craftsmanship that form the foundation of India’s rich cultural heritage.\n\nThrough patronage and celebration, we ensure a living legacy of artistry, and endeavour to sustain a living legacy of heritage, preservation and craft.\n\n#Sabyasachi #TheWorldOfSabyasachi #SabyasachiJewellery #SabyasachiAccessories #BridesOfSabyasachi", "channel": "sabyasachiofficial", "uploader_id": "1812374930", "uploader": "Sabyasachi", "timestamp": 1790318927, "like_count": 43687, "comment_count": 67, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2074037643998559a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 80.585, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fccj8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNe1JF61khAzTRwNkoVQO7Ewar7ygUmlOuPWjnudIPEP-PueuhZ_jXDD4SMpCVPcnVV1ng3tUFanazBscg1qMb-iWqOrebI_WmshIA.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=Adre_CUUiRilUWuO2fE2TBlvGmllVmFmCogUc33JHohnuhl-UwhrWlC15QxuvZ1cn28&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fccj8-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=1uqfcpYFZ9cQ7kNvwH9_ne9&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=xhNxlvQ7rpis2oAzMARChA&_nc_ss=7b689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQNIoRdW65sbodHajuSzbGyXhMvjQYk6ugKfsK8rO-MsdQ&oe=6AD0CE35", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 80.585, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xm